### Registrar novo usuário
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin_teste",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Login (salva o token numa variável global)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin_teste",
  "password": "senha123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("authToken", response.body.token);
%}

### Criar uma tarefa (usando o token salvo)
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "Estudar Spring Boot",
  "description": "Terminar o CRUD de tarefas",
  "dueDate": "2026-08-15"
}

### Listar todas as tarefas
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Buscar tarefa por id
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/5
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Atualizar tarefa
PUT http://localhost:8080/tasks/5
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "Estudar Spring Boot - atualizado",
  "description": "Terminar o CRUD e começar os testes",
  "dueDate": "2026-08-20"
}

### Listar por status
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/status/TODO
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Deletar tarefa
DELETE http://localhost:8080/tasks/5
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Buscar tarefa que não existe (testar erro 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/999
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Testar validação (título vazio e data no passado)
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "Teste de validação",
  "dueDate": "2020-01-01"
}

### Testar acesso SEM token (deve retornar 403)
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks

### Registrar usuário 1
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sergio2",
  "password": "senha123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("tokenSergio", response.body.token);
%}

### Registrar usuário 2
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "maria",
  "password": "senha123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("tokenMaria", response.body.token);
%}

### Sergio cria uma tarefa
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSergio}}

{
  "title": "Tarefa do Sergio",
  "dueDate": "2026-09-01"
}

### Maria cria uma tarefa
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMaria}}

{
  "title": "Tarefa da Maria",
  "dueDate": "2026-09-01"
}

### Sergio lista suas tarefas (deve ver só a dele)
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenSergio}}

### Maria lista suas tarefas (deve ver só a dela)
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenMaria}}

### Listar todas as tarefas como ADMIN (deve funcionar só com token de admin)
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/admin/all
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
